   "html": "<html><title>Teleport</title><body><center>\n\t<table width=270>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Main\" action=\"bypass -h admin_admin\" width=45 height=15 back=\"sek.cbui94\" fore=\"sek.cbui92\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td width=180 align=center>Teleport Menu</td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Back\" action=\"bypass -h admin_admin\" width=45 height=15 back=\"sek.cbui94\" fore=\"sek.cbui92\"></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table><br>\n\t<br>\n\t\n\tMove to locations\n\t<table width=280>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Town & Castle\" action=\"bypass admin_link tele/town_castle.htm\" width=95 height=21 back=\"bigbutton_over\" fore=\"bigbutton\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Hunting Zone\" action=\"bypass admin_link tele/hunting_zone.htm\" width=75 height=21 back=\"L2UI_ch3.Btn1_normalOn\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.Btn1_normal\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Other location\" action=\"bypass admin_link tele/other.htm\" width=95 height=21 back=\"bigbutton_over\" fore=\"bigbutton\"></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table><br>\n\t<br>\n\t\n\tMove to given coords\n\t<table width=240>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td width=10>X</td><td><edit var=\"char_cord_x\" width=50></td>\n\t\t\t<td width=10>Y</td><td><edit var=\"char_cord_y\" width=50></td>\n\t\t\t<td width=10>Z</td><td><edit var=\"char_cord_z\" width=50></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Go\" action=\"bypass admin_teleport $char_cord_x $char_cord_y $char_cord_z\" width=65 height=19 back=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2\"></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table><br>\n\t<br>\n\t\n\tMovement related actions\n\t<table width=200>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Normal\" action=\"bypass admin_instant_move 0\" width=65 height=19 back=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Teleport x1\" action=\"bypass admin_instant_move 1\" width=65 height=19 back=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Teleport\" action=\"bypass admin_instant_move 2\" width=65 height=19 back=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2\"></td>\n\t\t</tr><tr>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Strider\" action=\"bypass admin_ride 1\" width=65 height=19 back=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Wyvern\" action=\"bypass admin_ride 2\" width=65 height=19 back=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button value=\"Dismount\" action=\"bypass admin_unride\" width=65 height=19 back=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.smallbutton2\"></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table><br>\n\t<br>\n\t\n\tGM Speed\n\t<table width=187>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><button action=\"bypass admin_gmspeed 1\" width=34 height=24 back=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_1_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_1\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button action=\"bypass admin_gmspeed 2\" width=34 height=24 back=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_2_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_2\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button action=\"bypass admin_gmspeed 3\" width=34 height=24 back=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_3_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_3\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button action=\"bypass admin_gmspeed 4\" width=34 height=24 back=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_4_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_4\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td width=17></td>\n\t\t\t<td><button action=\"bypass admin_gmspeed 0\" width=34 height=24 back=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_c_over\" fore=\"L2UI_ch3.calculate2_c\"></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</center></body></html>\n"
